"<qt>\n"
"<p>Enable cookie support. Normally you will want to have cookie support "
"enabled and customize it to suit your privacy needs.</p><p>\n"
"Please note that disabling cookie support might make many web sites "
"unbrowsable.</p>\n"
"</qt>"
